Name: EXPSMOOTHWEIGHTS
Description: Exponential-smoothing weights for a column, default alpha 0.2. Residual mass is added to the first weight so they sum to 1.
Parameters: values, [alpha]
=LAMBDA(values,[alpha],LET(a,IF(ISOMITTED(alpha),0.2,alpha),n,ROWS(values),w,a*(1-a)^(n-SEQUENCE(n)),residual,1-SUM(w),w+(SEQUENCE(n)=1)*residual))
